 "words": 191,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I remember Sunday mornings and the singing in the hall",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How I walked among the people and I felt you over all",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the house is very quiet and the nights are very long",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.67,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I search for you in silence where I used to find a song",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 3.03,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As a deer longs for streams of water",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.31,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So my soul longs for you, O God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My soul thirsts for God, for the living God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When shall I come and appear before God's face",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 5.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My tears have been my food day and night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And still the voices ask me where you are",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I pour my heart out on the kitchen floor",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I hold on to the memory of the light",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As a deer longs for streams of water",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So my soul longs for you, O God",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "My soul thirsts for God, for the living God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "When shall I come and appear before God's face",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why are you cast down, my soul",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And why do you groan within me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hope in God, for I will praise him again",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 2.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As a deer longs for streams of water",
